{
  "schema_version": "1.0.0",
  "edition_id": "ASV1901",
  "book_code": "ROM",
  "chapter": 9,
  "verses": [
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.1",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.1",
      "verse": 1,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "I say the truth in Christ, I lie not, my conscience bearing witness with me in the Holy Spirit,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.2",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.2",
      "verse": 2,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "that I have great sorrow and unceasing pain in my heart.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.3",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.3",
      "verse": 3,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For I could wish that I myself were anathema from Christ for my brethren’s sake, my kinsmen according to the flesh:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.4",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.4",
      "verse": 4,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "who are Israelites; whose is the adoption, and the glory, and the covenants, and the giving of the law, and the service ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "of God",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": ", and the promises;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.5",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.5",
      "verse": 5,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "whose are the fathers, and of whom is Christ as concerning the flesh, who is over all, God blessed for ever. Amen.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.6",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.6",
      "verse": 6,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "But ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "it is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not as though the word of God hath come to nought. For they are not all Israel, that are of Israel:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.7",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.7",
      "verse": 7,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "neither, because they are Abraham’s seed, are they all children: but, In Isaac shall thy seed be called.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.8",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.8",
      "verse": 8,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "That is, it is not the children of the flesh that are children of God; but the children of the promise are reckoned for a seed.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.9",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.9",
      "verse": 9,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For this is a word of promise, According to this season will I come, and Sarah shall have a son.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.10",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.10",
      "verse": 10,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And not only so; but Rebecca also having conceived by one, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " by our father Isaac—",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.11",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.11",
      "verse": 11,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "for ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "the children",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " being not yet born, neither having done anything good or bad, that the purpose of God according to election might stand, not of works, but of him that calleth,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.12",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.12",
      "verse": 12,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "it was said unto her, The elder shall serve the younger.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.13",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.13",
      "verse": 13,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Even as it is written, Jacob I loved, but Esau I hated.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.14",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.14",
      "verse": 14,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What shall we say then? Is there unrighteousness with God? God forbid.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.15",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.15",
      "verse": 15,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For he saith to Moses, I will have mercy on whom I have mercy, and I will have compassion on whom I have compassion.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.16",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.16",
      "verse": 16,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So then it is not of him that willeth, nor of him that runneth, but of God that hath mercy.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.17",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.17",
      "verse": 17,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "For the scripture saith unto Pharaoh, For this very purpose did I raise thee up, that I might show in thee my power, and that my name might be published abroad in all the earth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.18",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.18",
      "verse": 18,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "So then he hath mercy on whom he will, and whom he will he hardeneth.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.19",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.19",
      "verse": 19,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Thou wilt say then unto me, Why doth he still find fault? For who withstandeth his will?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.20",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.20",
      "verse": 20,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Nay but, O man, who art thou that repliest against God? Shall the thing formed say to him that formed it, Why didst thou make me thus?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.21",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.21",
      "verse": 21,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Or hath not the potter a right over the clay, from the same lump to make one part a vessel unto honor, and another unto dishonor?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.22",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.22",
      "verse": 22,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What if God, willing to show his wrath, and to make his power known, endured with much longsuffering vessels of wrath fitted unto destruction:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.23",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.23",
      "verse": 23,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "and that he might make known the riches of his glory upon vessels of mercy, which he afore prepared unto glory,",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.24",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.24",
      "verse": 24,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "even",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " us, whom he also called, not from the Jews only, but also from the Gentiles?",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.25",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.25",
      "verse": 25,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "As he saith also in Hosea,I will call that my people, which was not my people;\nAnd her beloved, that was not beloved.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.26",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.26",
      "verse": 26,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And it shall be, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " in the place where it was said unto them, Ye are not my people,\nThere shall they be called sons of the living God.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.27",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.27",
      "verse": 27,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And Isaiah crieth concerning Israel, If the number of the children of Israel be as the sand of the sea, it is the remnant that shall be saved:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.28",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.28",
      "verse": 28,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "for the Lord will execute ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "his",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " word upon the earth, finishing it and cutting it short.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.29",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.29",
      "verse": 29,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "And, as Isaiah hath said before,Except the Lord of Sabaoth had left us a seed,\nWe had become as Sodom, and had been made like unto Gomorrah.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.30",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.30",
      "verse": 30,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "What shall we say then? That the Gentiles, who followed not after righteousness, attained to righteousness, even the righteousness which is of faith:",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": true
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.31",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.31",
      "verse": 31,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "but Israel, following after a law of righteousness, did not arrive at ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "that",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " law.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.32",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.32",
      "verse": 32,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "Wherefore? Because ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "they sought it",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " not by faith, but as it were by works. They stumbled at the stone of stumbling;",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ROM.9.33",
      "edition_verse_id": "ASV1901:ROM.9.33",
      "verse": 33,
      "spans": [
        {
          "text": "even as it is written,Behold, I lay in Zion a stone of stumbling and a rock of offence:\nAnd he that believeth on him shall not be put to shame.",
          "kind": "text"
        }
      ],
      "paragraph_start": false
    }
  ]
}
